# Force LF on checkout. CI runs in a Linux (Alpine) container and breaks on
# CRLF: a "#!/bin/sh\r" shebang makes `env` look for "sh\r", and a trailing \r
# on Makefile recipe lines gets parsed as part of a filename.
# This also self-heals files that were uploaded with Windows CRLF line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts are executed directly; their shebang must be exact.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Build scripts / metadata that must never be CRLF-mangled.
*.py text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.mk text eol=lf

# Binary assets must be left byte-for-byte.
*.irx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
